WEBVTT

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.750
Honestly. Don't scare me like that!

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.270
A vampire?

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.030
That can't be real!

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.950
I'm afraid it is.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.780
The guard told me while I was getting us 
through the checkpoint.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.430
Be careful, by the way.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:01.410
There's apparently a vampire 
in the town ahead.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.100
The last few days, 
they've been finding corpses, desiccated,

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.540
as if all the blood's been drained 
out of them.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:14.630
And one thing they all have in common 
is two marks on the neck, as if from fangs.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.050
The town! There!

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.880
Why don't we camp out here 
instead of going into town?

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.810
Hey, don't worry. You'll be fine.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:34.030
It only goes after beautiful women.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.190
You wouldn't qualify—

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.200
Freaking ow!

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.490
I'm glad the town is so active!

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:24.240
Frau and the Vampire

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:23.580
Let's find an inn first.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:25.950
Good idea.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.650
Is that a demihuman?

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.080
It's so unsettling.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.230
We'd better report it to the guard.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.620
Those big jerks!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:40.740
Leave it.

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:43.630
This region is hostile to demihumans.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.240
There's a lot of discrimination, too.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.290
Let's just go.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.850
Why don't you teach them a lesson?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.630
Use your power to punish those humans!

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:03.530
I can't.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:07.100
It doesn't seem that 
I can use my power against humans.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.430
<i>Can't use her power against humans?</i>

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:17.190
<i>She can kill ogres, 
but refuses to even harm her own kind?</i>

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.190
<i>That's utterly...</i>

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:20.660
<i>Sally...</i>

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.070
<i>I thought you were different 
from other humans!</i>

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:25.740
Carrot?

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.120
Hey, there's an inn!

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:31.410
You're right. Now we can rest.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:32.810
Yeah.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.460
But given the reaction we saw earlier,

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.420
we probably shouldn't bring a demihuman with us.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.920
Maybe you can persuade them 
the way you did before!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.360
We're through the checkpoint.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.680
My title doesn't mean anything here.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.670
I don't feel great about it,

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:55.190
but we might need to have
 Frau sneak in to join us later.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.550
That's stupid!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:59.130
Why does Frau have to be the one 
sneaking around?

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.960
Frau doesn't mind.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.080
Really? You don't mind?

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:08.190
No. Frau will buy things 
while you get a room.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.920
They shouldn't be alone.

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.490
I'll go with them.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.460
Thanks, Carrot!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:22.140
<i>She won't raise a hand against her own kind,</i>

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:25.850
<i>but she's happy to compromise 
with the fate of her companions.</i>

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:28.620
Sally?

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:29.730
R-Right...

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.220
What did you want to buy?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:37.840
A hood. Something to disguise.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.980
Carrots!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.490
Wait! What about the hood?!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.490
You really do love carrots, don't you?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.290
You filthy demihuman!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.500
You think you're something special, 
judging my stock like that?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.320
If you're gonna buy, buy! 
Then get outta my sight!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.530
Gonna buy.

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:03.380
And I guess you've got money?

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.430
Yes.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.130
Hand it over!

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.900
<i>What is this I'm feeling?</i>

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:10.650
Here's your change.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.510
You want it? Pick it up yourself!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.480
The things I have to deal with...

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:31.950
We finally got a room!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.580
Once the other two are back, 
we can rest.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.950
You think they're close by?

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.500
We should probably find them 
sooner than later.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.710
I'm worried about Frau, 
but even more about Carrot.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:46.460
Why Carrot?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.980
Carrot's a former ogre.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:06.030
She's got nerves of steel, 
and she's used to fighting.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:10.070
But I doubt she's used to experiencing 
human animosity.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.850
Human animosity?

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:14.800
She's close to Frau.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:20.620
If she witnesses the discrimination 
that Frau experiences from humans...

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:24.130
I'll go fetch them.

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:33.690
What's wrong with the people of this city?

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:35.740
How can they treat you this way?

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:38.130
Not "of this city."

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:40.230
Normal human stuff.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.700
You mean you've been suffering
 this treatment the whole time?!

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.650
Yeah.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.770
Why don't you ever fight back?

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:50.030
Used to it.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:55.340
Frau got used to it, 
so can't fight back now.

00:07:55.940 --> 00:08:00.540
Only people like Sally make it better.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.150
Sally?

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.420
Sally?!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.420
Carrot?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:12.430
I thought Sally was different 
from other humans, too.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:17.250
But... when push came to shove, 
Sally sided with the humans.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.480
And she has that dangerous power.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.300
That power protects Frau, you, everyone!

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.670
That power...!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.060
That power killed Sett.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:30.990
You've become so dependent on Sally 
that you can't even see it anymore.

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.290
How dangerous she is...

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.580
Did you hear? 
There's a demihuman in town.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:42.170
How awful! I hope it's gone soon!

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:44.330
<i>You filthy, disgusting humans!</i>

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:48.580
<i>If I had my ogre power, 
I'd slaughter you all right now!</i>

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.830
First the vampire, now this...

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.090
It's one dangerous thing after another.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.090
"Vampire"?

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.860
That power. I'd know it anywhere!

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:13.610
He'll do it.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:18.490
<i>He'll</i> slaughter everyone 
in this city for me!

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.840
Where could they be?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.750
Excuse me, miss!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.380
Looking for dinner?

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.510
<i>O-Octopus!</i>

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:40.670
The traveling merchants brought
 this creature, an octopus.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.600
Let's all try it together!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.960
Wow!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.360
It's so funny how it wriggles!

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.330
M-Miss? Are you all right?

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.370
I-It's a bit traumatic.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.870
My eye... Why?

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.880
It's been some time, Kyuketsuki.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.300
Meki...

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:21.390
<b>High Ogre 
Kyuketsuki</b>

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.390
It's been a long time 
since I saw another of our kind.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:24.890
There's a favor I wished 
to ask to you, my kinsman.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:28.880
Be a dear and slaughter the people 
of this city, won't you?

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.420
Don't be absurd.

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:33.400
If you want it done, 
you can do it yourself.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:36.900
I would, if I had access to all my power.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.350
You... Your horn...

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.980
She slayed Sett 
and destroyed Juki in one hit?

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.550
It's hard to believe.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:53.920
I've grown weary of my existence, 
reduced to days of killing time.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:57.170
But a battle might bring a 
little spark back to my life.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.230
This human, Sally...

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:01.410
I wonder how she tastes.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:05.860
No! I only want you 
to kill the townspeople!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.600
Didn't you want me 
to kill all the humans?

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:15.610
I certainly hope you're not thinking, 
"Kill them all, except my companions."

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:21.090
Sally is an imminent threat to ogrekind, 
and thus the one whom I most need to kill.

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:25.120
If you're still an ogre, as you claim, 
that should be your priority.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.910
K-Kill... S-Sa...

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.760
Don't have to say.

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:43.410
Frau!

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:45.630
The much-rumored demihuman, eh?

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:47.060
How did you find me?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.890
Searched.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:51.390
Your feet...

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:54.900
Carrot. Come back with Frau.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.420
Harefolk.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:12:00.820
Pardon my rudeness, 
but I have urgent business to attend to.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.830
I'm going to kill this "Sally" human.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:08.540
Frau has business with you now, too.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.660
Do you, now?

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:16.350
Slow.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:22.050
Weak.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.930
Is that the best you have?

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.360
Frau!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.690
I feel it. It's close!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.860
You were a pleasing enough opening act.

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:45.200
I needed a warm-up anyway.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:50.450
Don't worry. 
I'll make your death quick and painless.

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.210
<i>The horns are the source of an ogre's power.</i>

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:55.460
<i>And Kyuketsuki's horns are...</i>

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:58.960
Kyuketsuki! Stop—

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.420
Cannon!

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.200
F-Frau...

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.200
Frau!

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:32.370
S-Sally...

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.450
Came to me, did you?

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.870
That saves me time.

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.880
Sally, was it?

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:47.450
<i>She's quite fast for a human,</i>

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:49.510
<i>but if this is all the power 
her rage affords her,</i>

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.810
<i>she won't even match up 
to that harefolk.</i>

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.050
<i>What?</i>

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:02.890
<i>Why does an unassisted punch, 
at that speed, hurt so much?</i>

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:05.900
<i>This isn't physical or magical strength.</i>

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:08.030
<i>What </i>is<i> this power?</i>

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.130
I am Kyuketsuki, the ogre of blood.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:23.550
I drink blood and control it.

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.050
Are you?

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.220
Too bad that didn't hurt at all.

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:31.090
Impossible!

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:35.310
I'm told my body has resistance 
to ogre power.

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:39.810
Despite this, 
I bear no ill will to ogres.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.560
But right now, you're an exception!

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:49.990
I told you that wouldn't work!

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.740
It may not work on your body,

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:57.750
but it seems your clothing is another story.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:03.420
What is this stuff?

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.010
Narrow streams of blood, 
drawn taut as thread,

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:08.620
binding your clothing to the ground.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.770
I don't know what your power is,

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:14.650
but it's nothing 
once I know how to plan around it.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:35.930
You claim you're resistant to ogre power.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:41.460
Let's find out if you can endure my cannon!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.590
What are you doing, Meki?

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:52.720
Carrot!

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:56.340
Were you trying 
to save this human just now?

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:57.650
It's not that!

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:00.020
I absolutely despise humans!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:00.980
Then why...

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.480
But... Sally and I are companions!

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:08.980
So... I don't want to let her die!

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:14.610
I see.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.350
So you're the same way...

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:21.980
Kyuketsuki?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.550
Then I'll do you the favor

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.750
of sending you both off together!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:39.310
Please proceed in the direction of the light!

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.530
You'll find the paperwork you need there!

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:43.250
Atla?

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:47.020
Frau?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.590
Hey! Don't you know this is heaven?

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.070
Are you dead again?

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.530
Sorry.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.750
That's twice in one year!

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.300
What happened this time?

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.400
Upper half blasted off.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.570
Why don't you just live here already?

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.550
Companions waiting.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:18.900
Then it's the usual: 
Revival, not reincarnation?

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.180
And...

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:22.310
Going to use some power.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.130
What? You can't!

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:28.030
Don't forget! 
You still have a body of flesh!

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.470
Your body and soul won't hold out!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.690
Don't mind.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.570
Need only one shot for him.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:39.030
Oh, fine.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.420
I'll send you back, then.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.980
Just stand there and close your eyes.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.710
Thanks, Atla.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.420
Carrot! Run away!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.540
No!

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:59.340
If I'm going to die, 
I want to die with you and Frau!

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:00.550
Don't be—

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:14.010
Frau!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.110
Frau!

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:26.330
Frau?

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.630
Why do you look like that?

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.470
The blood did have a curious taste to it.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:37.220
You're not really harefolk, are you?

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:41.120
What are you really, creature?!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:52.470
<i>It blasted aside 
my congealed blood so easily.</i>

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:54.530
<i>Where did it—</i>

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:17.130
To take me out with one hit...

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.340
Reached limit.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.020
Frau!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.060
I'm free!

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:34.150
I can't move another drop of blood.

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:38.860
I see. 
I can finally die, then.

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:43.310
I'm sorry I left you waiting so long.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.490
Meki.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.940
Y-Yes?

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:50.190
You said that you and Sally were companions.

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:53.500
Does that mean 
you've betrayed the ogres?

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.060
I...

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.840
I won't judge you for it.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.300
I did the same thing.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:03.000
A ring?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.830
Isn't that a wedding ring?!

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.900
Because my horns are my fangs,

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:11.990
it was easy for me to live among humans.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.940
I pretended to be human 
and lived among them for fun.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.240
And then I met a woman.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.580
I was enchanted.

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:31.580
The days we spent together were pure bliss.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:33.940
Too much bliss...

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:37.580
Enough that I forgot what I really am.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.020
And the next thing I knew...

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:08.310
I'd done it entirely without thinking.

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:12.870
It was my ogre instincts, 
devoid of mind and emotion.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:17.320
Meki. You may curse the loss of your horn,

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:21.230
but its loss has likely removed 
your ogre instincts.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:24.260
I envy you that.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:30.630
Had I also lost my horns, 
I might not have lost what really mattered.

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:34.270
Kyuketsuki!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.480
I'm going to die now.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:38.850
Go on.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:41.690
The sun will come up soon.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:45.140
Now's the only time you can transport 
that harefolk inconspicuously.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.340
You...

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:48.410
Go.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:51.560
Sally.

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:02.000
Carrot...

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.860
Live a long life.

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:50.250
Carrot and Millia

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:48.650
Next time: "Carrot and Millia."
